{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國外交部今天上午一連發出兩份外交部令，對巴拉圭通信和技術部長比利亞特（Gustavo Emigdio Villate Samaniego）和伯利茲外交、外貿、教育、文化、科學和技術部長豐塞卡（Francis Fonseca）實施「反制措施」。</p><p>這是北京首度制裁台灣「邦交國」政要。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T08:02:52.910478+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T07:08:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T18:17:38.724951+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T07:57:40.035674+00:00","content_hash":"00a9624f51b05739ad0499a2748250d37a7d6aaeab05457c9bbb9b5b80d320b3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}